flowchart TD
    A[Retention trigger or verified privacy request] --> B[Resolve subject, tenant, purpose and authority]
    B --> C[Discover owner records and governed copies]
    C --> D{Active duty, dispute, incident or legal hold?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Restrict covered data and record review/release condition]
    D -->|No| F[Decide delete, anonymize, correct, export or return]
    F --> G[Execute domain-owner operations]
    G --> H[Propagate to search, cache, objects, device sync, analytics and processors]
    H --> I[Write minimal tombstone and completion manifest]
    I --> J{Any failed tasks?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Retry and escalate with deadline]
    J -->|No| L[Communicate accurate completion and limitations]
    E --> M[Periodic hold review]
    M -->|Released| F
    I --> N[Backup restore replays tombstones before reopening]
